// model_migration.rs.template
// Model migration utilities for seamless transitions between model versions
//
// DESIGN DECISIONS:
// - Versioned migration system with rollback capability
// - Hot-swapping for zero-downtime model updates
// - Progressive deployment with A/B testing support
// - Automatic compatibility checking and validation
// - Backup and restore mechanisms for safe migrations
//
// INTEGRATION POINTS:
// - src/integration/model_persistence_service.rs (model storage)
// - ensemble_predictor.rs (model orchestration)
// - src/monitoring/health/component_checkers.rs (migration monitoring)
// - Redis for coordination and state management

